# ── Pipeline scripts: tracked deliberately ────────────────────────────────────
# Tracked so the Monday pipeline survives a machine change — the fixes used to
# live only on the build machine. Negations must come AFTER the broad rules above
# (last match wins) and a directory must be un-ignored before files inside it can
# be re-included.
#
# Scripts only. NOT tracked, deliberately:
#   - credentials.py                      real secrets
#   - fy_*.html/.png, matrix_icon_*.html  Playwright page dumps of logged-in
#                                         iasWorld/MLS sessions (may contain
#                                         session state and owner PII)
#   - *.sql                               internal query with DB schema
#   - test_cama_*.csv, perfect_matches.xlsx, photo folders   real parcel data
# Pattern matters: un-ignore the directory, re-ignore ALL of its contents, then
# re-include only *.py. Skipping the middle step pulls in the page dumps, the SQL
# and the sample data too (verified — it does).
!Automation Domination/
Automation Domination/*
!Automation Domination/*.py
Automation Domination/credentials.py
!ZillowPhotos/
ZillowPhotos/*
!ZillowPhotos/*.py
!build_portal.py
